<% content_for :footer, render("digest_footer", user: @user, kind: "digest emails") -%>
Weekly summary for <%= email_date(@today) %>

<% if @expiring.empty? && @gaps.empty? -%>
All clear. Nothing has expired or expires in the next 30 days, and everyone on an active project holds every certificate it requires.
<% else -%>
<%= pluralize(@expiring.size - @expired_count, "certificate") %> expiring within 30 days, <%= @expired_count %> already expired, and <%= pluralize(@gaps.size, "gap") %> (missing, expired or confirmed fake) on active projects.

EXPIRED OR EXPIRING WITHIN 30 DAYS
<% if @expiring.empty? -%>
Nothing has expired or expires in the next 30 days.
<% end -%>
<% @expiring.each do |item| -%>
- <%= item.crew_member.display_name %>, <%= item_line(item) %> [<%= threshold_label(item) %>]
<% if (member_url = crew_member_url_or_nil(item.crew_member)) -%>
  <%= member_url %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

GAPS ON ACTIVE PROJECTS
<% if @gaps.empty? -%>
No gaps: everyone on an active project holds every certificate it requires.
<% end -%>
<% @gap_groups.each do |project, gaps| -%>

<%= project.display_name %><% if (compliance_url = project_compliance_url_or_nil(project)) %>: <%= compliance_url %><% end %>
<% gaps.each do |gap| -%>
  - <%= gap.crew_member.display_name %>, <%= gap.certificate_type.name %>: <%= gap_status_text(gap) %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

Open CertTrack: <%= root_url %>
